    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partners Darragh O Se are thrilled to bring to the market Dromcunning, Abbeydorney. This is a wonderful opportunity to acquire a spacious four-bedroom detached home in the peaceful rural setting of Dromcunning, Abbeydorney, Co. Kerry. This attractive property offers generous, well-proportioned accommodation and would make an ideal family home.\r\nThe accommodation comprises four bedrooms, a welcoming living area, kitchen/dining space and family bathroom, with the property offering plenty of scope to make it your own. Large windows throughout provide excellent natural light, while the detached layout offers privacy and flexibility for family living. The property benefits from ample outdoor space, providing an ideal setting for families, gardening enthusiasts or anyone looking to enjoy the peace and privacy of rural Kerry. Located in Dromcunning, the property enjoys a countryside setting while remaining within easy reach of Abbeydorney village and its local amenities. Tralee is also conveniently accessible, providing a wide range of facilities.This property represents an excellent opportunity for buyers seeking a detached family home in a quiet and scenic location, while still being within easy commuting distance of Tralee and surrounding towns. BER is C. Viewing is highly recommended"
      },
